meta {
	name: 02_RequestAndApproveAsRequested
	seq: 2
}

docs {
	Scenario: An organisation asks a person for one right and gets exactly that

		Given the approver has no pending request from the requester for the resource
		And the approver can delegate at least one right on the resource
		When the requester asks for one right on the resource through v2
		And the approver approves the request without selecting rights
		Then the request is Approved with the requested right as the approved right
		And the requester sees the request as Approved
		Finally the approver removes the delegation to clean up
}
